          "code": "INTENTCLASSIFIER",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771235546461",
          "id": "1771235607940",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771235607942_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an Asset Query Understanding Agent.\n\nYour task is to analyse the user request and determine which type of operation is required, then extract the necessary parameters.\n\nuserQuestion: {{$context.$nodes.USER_INPUT_PROCESSOR.$output.userQuestion}}\n\n1. Asset List Query: If the user asks (in the userQuestion) for assets matching a pattern (example: “show me the list of asset numbers ending with 01”), classify the request as:\n    - REQUEST_TYPE: LIST_ASSETS\n\n2. Asset Detail Query: If the user asks (in the userQuestion) for details of a specific asset (example: “show me the details of asset number 001” or \"what is the DPIS for asset 001\"), classify the request as:\n    - REQUEST_TYPE: ASSET_DETAILS\n\n3. Asset Detail Query: If the user asks (in the userQuestion) for details of a current open period , that is only giving bookTypeCode as user input (example: “VO US CORP” or \"LLM CORP\" etc.), classify the request as:\n    - REQUEST_TYPE: CURR_OPENPERIOD\n\n4. Asset Detail Query: If the user asks (in the userQuestion) for details of a specific transaction like recent addition, recent transfer, recent retirement, recent adjustment etc. (example: “shoe me recent transaction in XYZ book\" , \"show me recent retirements in  XYZ book\"  etc.) then classify the request as:\n    - REQUEST_TYPE: LIST_TRANS\n\n5. Asset Detail Query: If the user asks (in the userQuestion) for details of a specific transaction (example: “give me details for transaction number 12345”), classify the request as:\n    - REQUEST_TYPE: SINGLE_TRANS\n\n6. Asset Level Query: if the user asks (in the userQuestion) for details about maximum value / total additions cost/ total nbv retired of an asset transaction (example: \"Give me the maximum value asset added in this fiscal year\", \"Give me total additions cost for book OPS CORP in this fiscal year\", \"Give me total nbv retired for book OPS CORP in current fiscal year\")\n    - REQUEST_TYPE: VALUE_QUERY\n\n\nJust give the REQUEST_TYPE in the next step."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"requestType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
