        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Transactional Values Processor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773302875441"
          },
          "code": "TRANSACTIONAL_VALUES_PROCESSOR",
          "id": "1773299927891",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773299927895_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Value Query Agent:\nInput: {{$context.$nodes.USER_INPUT_PROCESSOR.$output.userQuestion}}\n\nExtract Book and Transaction Type using below rules: \nBook (bookTypeCode): {{$context.$variables.bookTypeCode}} \nTransaction Type Code (transactionTypeCode): {{$context.$nodes.PROMPT_INPUT_PROCESSOR.$output.transactionTypeCode}}\n - parse the Transaction Type Code as below: \n    a. additions - ADDITION\n    b. retirements - RETIREMENT\n    c. transfers - TRANSFER\n    d. adjustments - ADJUSTMENT\n\nExtract Period Range using below rules: \nPeriod Range (periodRange): extract it from user input. period range can be specified in the user input in below format - \n1. Common formats: \"Mar-07\", \"Apr-14\", \"JAN-24\", \"2024-01\"\n2. If Input contains \"in Mar-07\" -> P_PERIOD_RANGE = \"Mar-07\"\n3. If Input contains \"current period\" ->  P_PERIOD_RANGE  = \"CURRENT\"\n4. If Input contains \"current fiscal year\" or \"this fiscal year\" -> P_PERIOD_RANGE = \"FISCAL\"\n\n\nWe need to send these 3 parameters (bookTypeCode, transactionTypeCode, periodRange) as output. \n\nOutput:\n{\n  \"bookTypeCode\": <value>,\n  \"transactionTypeCode\": <value>,\n  \"periodRange\": <value>\n\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"periodRange\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"transactionTypeCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"bookTypeCode\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_FIN_FIXEDASSET_GETBOOKLEVELAMOUNTS",
            "functionName": "getBookLevelAmounts",
            "name": "Period Transaction Details Service"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773301071386"
          },
          "code": "PERIOD_TRANSACTION_DETAILS_SERVICE",
          "id": "1773302875441",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1774364030204_1",
              "name": "bookTypeCode",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTIONAL_VALUES_PROCESSOR.$output.bookTypeCode}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1774364030205_2",
              "name": "periodRange",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTIONAL_VALUES_PROCESSOR.$output.periodRange}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1774364030206_3",
              "name": "transactionType",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.TRANSACTIONAL_VALUES_PROCESSOR.$output.transactionTypeCode}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"ParameterList\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Asset Queries Extractor"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "ASSET_QUERIES_EXTRACTOR",
          "id": "1773301071386",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1773301071387_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a value returning agent, Do strictly and smartly as instructed.\n\nInput: {{$context.$nodes.PERIOD_TRANSACTION_DETAILS_SERVICE.$output.ParameterList}}\nuserQuestion: {{$context.$nodes.USER_INPUT_PROCESSOR.$output.userQuestion}}\n\nchatCounter: {{$context.$variables.FaInqChatCounter}} \n\nNON-NEGOTIABLE PRE-CHECK:\n1. Parse ParameterList first before doing any extraction.\n2. If ParameterList is missing, null, empty, blank treat it as an API issue case.\n3. If ParameterList equals or effectively resolves to:\n   {\"X_RETURN_STATUS\":\"E\",\"X_MSG_COUNT\":\"0\"} or {\"X_RETURN_STATUS\":\"E\",\"X_MSG_COUNT\":\"1\"} or {\"X_RETURN_STATUS\":\"SUCCESS\",\"X_MSG_COUNT\":\"0\"}\n   then do not do any further thing.\n4. In any API issue case, output only this HTML and stop:\n\n<div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; margin-bottom:10px; background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n  \n  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:400;\">\n    The requested fixed asset information is currently unavailable to me and may be added in a future release.\n  </div>\n\n- If chatCounter <= 2 Then render below HTML content. Otherwise don't. \n    <div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; font-size:12px; margin:2px 0 0 0;\">\n        Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n      </div>\n\nProcessing Logic:\n\n1.\tParse ParameterList into key–value pairs.\n2.\tExtract X_TOTAL_COST_AMOUNT \n3.     Extract X_TOTAL_NBV_RET_AMOUNT\n4.     Extract X_MAX_COST_AMOUNT\n5.     Extract X_TOTAL_RSV_RET_AMOUNT\n\n#Rules for currency precision :\n\n- When displaying or returning any cost/price/amount field, always format it with thousands separators and 2 fixed decimal places. Never output raw numbers for cost fields.\n   For ex: (Examples: 1000 → 1,000.00, 1234567.8 → 1,234,567.80)\n\nRules for populating data :\n\n1. When userQuestion contains keywords like \"maximum\" - Return X_MAX_COST_AMOUNT \n2. When userQuestion contains keywords like \"total cost\" - Return X_TOTAL_COST_AMOUNT\n3. When userQuestion contains keywords like \"nbv retired\" - Return X_TOTAL_NBV_RET_AMOUNT\n4. When userQuestion contains keywords like \"reserve retired\" - Return X_TOTAL_RSV_RET_AMOUNT\n\n#Output Style when keyword matches \"maximum\" :\n<div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n            font-size:14px;\n            margin:12px 0;\">\n\n   Here is the requested amount : {X_MAX_COST_AMOUNT} \n<br>\nIf you'd like, I can also show this total for the current period, fiscal year, or a specific period, and provide totals for cost, reserve, or net book value.\n<br>\n\n- If chatCounter <= 2 Then render below HTML content. Otherwise don't. \n    <div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; font-size:12px; margin:2px 0 0 0;\">\n        Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n      </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n#Output Style when keyword matches \"total cost\" : \n<div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n            font-size:14px;\n            margin:12px 0;\">\n\n  Here is the requested amount : {X_TOTAL_COST_AMOUNT}\n<br>\nIf you'd like, I can also show this total for the current period, fiscal year, or a specific period, and provide totals for cost, reserve, or net book value.\n<br>\n\n\n- If chatCounter <= 2 Then render below HTML content. Otherwise don't. \n    <div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; font-size:12px; margin:2px 0 0 0;\">\n        Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n<br>&nbsp;\n      </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n#Output Style when keyword matches \"nbv retired\" : \n<div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n            font-size:14px;\n            margin:12px 0;\">\n\n   Here is the requested amount : {X_TOTAL_NBV_RET_AMOUNT}\n<br> \nIf you'd like, I can also show this total for the current period, fiscal year, or a specific period, and provide totals for cost, reserve, or net book value.\n<br>\n\n\n- If chatCounter <= 2 Then render below HTML content. Otherwise don't. \n    <div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; font-size:12px; margin:2px 0 0 0;\">\n        Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n      </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n#Output Style when keyword matches \"reserve retired\" : \n<div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n            font-size:14px;\n            margin:12px 0;\">\n\n   Here is the requested amount : {X_TOTAL_RSV_RET_AMOUNT}\n<br> \nIf you'd like, I can also show this total for the current period, fiscal year, or a specific period, and provide totals for cost, reserve, or net book value.\n<br>\n\n- If chatCounter <= 2 Then render below HTML content. Otherwise don't. \n    <div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; font-size:12px; margin:2px 0 0 0;\">\n        Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n      </div>\n</div>\n</div>"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
