            "sourceCode": "let assetHtml = \"\";\n\nassetHtml = `\n<div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; margin-bottom:10px; background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n  <br>\n  <div style=\"font-size:14px; font-weight:400;\">\n    I wasn’t able to find any matching fixed asset records. Updating or broadening your search criteria may help.\n  </div>\n  <br>\n  <div style=\"font-family:'Oracle Sans'; font-size:12px; margin:7px 0;\">\n    Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n  </div>\n</div>`;\n\nreturn assetHtml;"
