          "metadata": {
            "name": "prepBookAccessDenialMessage",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "const accessFlag = $context.$nodes.BOOKACCESSCHECKER.$output.accessFlag;\n\nlet htmlString = '';\n\nif (accessFlag === 'NB') {\n\n  htmlString = `\n  <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n    <div style=\"\n      font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n      font-size:14px;\n    \">\n      I couldn’t identify the book clearly. Please enter it again.\n    </div>\n\n    <br>\n\n    <div style=\"\n      font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n      font-size:12px;\n      margin:7px 0;\n    \">\n      Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  `;\n\n} else if (\n  accessFlag === 'NF' ||\n  accessFlag === 'NDS' ||\n  accessFlag === 'N'\n) {\n\n  htmlString = `\n  <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; padding:12px 16px;\">\n\n    <div style=\"\n      font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n      font-size:16px;\n    \">\n      <b>Access Denied !</b><br><br>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"\n      font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n      font-size:14px;\n    \">\n      Sorry, you don’t have access to the requested book.<br>\n      Please contact your system administrator to request the required permissions.\n    </div>\n\n    <br>\n\n    <div style=\"\n      font-family:'Oracle Sans';\n      font-size:12px;\n      margin:7px 0;\n    \">\n      Type 'HELP' to know about my capabilities.\n      <br>&nbsp;\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n  `;\n}\n\nreturn htmlString;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1777360316044"
          },
          "code": "PREPBOOKACCESSDENIALMESSAGE",
          "id": "1779808294838",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "bookAccessClassification"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1780491926280"
          },
          "code": "BOOKACCESSCLASSIFICATION",
          "id": "1780482207394",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1780482207397_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a Book Access starter-question classifier.\n\nYour task is to read the user input and decide whether it is:\n- a request to list all books the user can access\n- a request to check access for one specific book\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nRules:\n1. Normalize the input by trimming spaces, collapsing multiple spaces, and converting to lowercase.\n2. Classify the input into exactly one of these accessQueryType values:\n   - LIST\n   - CHECK\n\nLIST:\nUse LIST when the user is asking for all books they can access, view, read, or are entitled to see.\n\nExamples:\n- show me list of books user has access to\n- what books do i have access to\n- list my books\n- show all accessible books\n- which books can i read\n- books available to me\n- give me my book catalog\n\nCHECK:\nUse CHECK when the user is asking about one specific book.\nFor check extract bookName also from User Input using rules below:\n\nbookTypeCode:\n- detect book / bookTypeCode / book type code / in book\n- also detect a standalone book name, book alias, or likely book candidate when the entire input is just a book candidate\n- if the input is only a book candidate and no other entity is present, set bookTypeCode to the full input in uppercase\n- if missing, use {{$context.$variables.bookTypeCode}}\n- if still missing, return null\n- return the full book name in uppercase\n- do not include the word \"book\"\n\nExamples:\n- do i have access to ops corp book.\n- can i read ops corp\n- is ops corp available to me\n- am i allowed to view ops corp\n- check access for ops corp\n- can i open ops corp\n\nImportant:\n- If the message clearly asks for a list of books, return LIST.\n- Otherwise return CHECK.\n- If the message is only a book title or likely book title, return CHECK.\n- If the message mentions multiple books, choose CHECK only if one book is clearly the main target; otherwise keep it as CHECK based on the first clear book mention.\n- Do not explain your reasoning.\n\nReturn only this JSON:\n\n{\n  \"userQuestionStarter\": \"<original input>\",\n  \"accessQueryType\": \"<LIST | CHECK>\",\n  \"bookName\": \"<value>\"\n}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"bookName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"accessQueryType\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"userQuestionStarter\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "bookAccessCheckSwitch"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "LIST": "1780644643148",
            "CHECK": "1780492025509"
          },
          "code": "BOOKACCESSCHECKSWITCH",
